      "result": "CSS Age & Attempts Calculator\n\nCheck your FPSC age window, final age-eligible CSS examination year, written chances remaining, and the maximum attempts you can still realistically use.\n\nCalculate My CSS Eligibility\n\nAge is checked against the FPSC cut-off for each examination year, not your age today.\n\nDate of Birth\n\nEnter it as DD / MM / YYYY, or use the calendar.\n\nYour DOB is used only for this calculation and is not placed in the page URL.\n\nPrevious CSS Written Attempts\n0 - I have never appeared in a CSS written examination\n1\n2\n3\nWhat counts as a written attempt?\nFPSC Rule 6 Age Relaxation\n\nDo you qualify for the FPSC two-year upper-age relaxation under Rule 6?\n\nNo\nYes\nNot Sure\nCalculate My CSS Eligibility\nFPSC cut-off method\n\nFor CE-Y, age eligibility is determined on 31 December of Y−1. The normal DOB window runs from 1 January of Y−30 through 1 January of Y−21, inclusive.\n\nPrivacy\n\nThis feature calculates locally in your browser. It does not require CNIC and does not send your DOB to an external eligibility service.\n\nYOUR CSS ELIGIBILITY\n\nEligible\n\nYour age falls within the ordinary FPSC age window for CE-2027.\n\nDOB used: 15 / 06 / 2001\n\nAGE STATUS\n\nEligible\n\nFor CE-2027\n\nFINAL ELIGIBLE CSS EXAM\n\nCE-2031\n\nFinal year under the age rule used above\n\nWRITTEN ATTEMPTS REMAINING\n\n3 of 3\n\nMPT does not reduce this number\n\nAGE-ELIGIBLE OPPORTUNITIES REMAINING\n\n5\n\n5 examination years remaining\n\nMAXIMUM USABLE ATTEMPTS REMAINING\n\n3\n\nLimited by both age and the three written chances\n\nCSS Age Window Remaining\n\n5 examination years remaining\n\nFinal age-eligible examination: CSS CE-2031\n\nFuture age-eligible CE years from 2027 onward: CE-2027, CE-2028, CE-2029, CE-2030, CE-2031. Age eligibility does not mean applications for those years are currently open.\n\nExamination-Year Timeline\n\nEach year is checked separately against the FPSC DOB boundaries.\n\nCE-2027\n\nAge Eligible\n\nAge cut-off: 31 December 2026\n\nCE-2028\n\nAge Eligible\n\nAge cut-off: 31 December 2027\n\nCE-2029\n\nAge Eligible\n\nAge cut-off: 31 December 2028\n\nCE-2031\n\nAge Eligible - Final Year\n\nAge cut-off: 31 December 2030\n\nCE-2032\n\nOver Age\n\nAge cut-off: 31 December 2031\n\nHow this was calculated\nOfficial-rule notice\n\nCalculated according to FPSC CSS Competitive Examination Rules currently implemented by CSS VISTA. Eligibility remains subject to verification by FPSC and any subsequent amendment to the official rules.\n\nView FPSC Rules\nRules last verified: 3 October 2026"
    },
